msgid "A state reply has the following form::"
msgstr "状态回复格式如下::"

#: docs/silkie/flow-protocol.rst:113
msgid "A hard reset, the shared extension reset, or a shell integration prompt mark restores the configured writing directions and automatic reading order. Existing characters retain their individual reading hints until overwritten or erased."
msgstr "硬重置、通用扩展重置或 shell 集成的提示符标记都会恢复配置文件中的书写方向，并启用自动朗读顺序。现有字符保留各自的朗读提示，直至被覆盖或擦除。"
